    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Glass dishes that hold milkeye paste turn cloudy white and stay that way.</p><p><em>&amp;Reference[contactpoison] Poison</em></p><p>A creature that touches this poison, for example on a handle or a page, must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=15 format=long]] or have the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] and &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] conditions for 10 minutes. On a failed save it also takes [[/damage 3d6 type=poison]] damage, or half as much on a successful one.</p>",
